                <mxCell id="api" value="SignalRQueueDemo.ApiService&#xa;ASP.NET Core minimal API (.NET 10)&#xa;&#xa;GET /checkin/token  ← issues check-in token (public)&#xa;POST /checkin · POST /queue/call-next&#xa;POST /queue/{id}/complete · GET /queue&#xa;GET /queue/since/{seq}  ← reconnect catch-up&#xa;POST /checkin/{id}/documents  ← upload (public)&#xa;GET /queue/{id}/documents(/{docId})  ← staff&#xa;&#xa;StaffAuthFilter (X-Staff-Key) · CheckInTokenFilter (HMAC)&#xa;+ restricted CORS (KnownFrontends) on REST + hub&#xa;&#xa;QueueHub (SignalR, self-hosted per ADR-0001)&#xa;broadcasts QueueUpdated with monotonic seq #" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="560" y="240" width="360" height="290" as="geometry"/>
